      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0017" n="art0017">
        <head>Cocoanut Ca kem.</head>
        <p>Cocoanut Ca kem.</p>
        <p>Beat 4oz. of butter win: four a powdered sugar until it is white, add tie grated peel of a lenton, and beat into it the yolk .4 of two eggs add 4oz. of dour and tiox. of desiccated coca-mut, in alternate Fpoon f u Is, with the stiffly-whipped Whites a four egg. Divide the mixture into 12 or 14 buttered patty pans, sprinkle a little of the cocoanut on the top of each, and bake in a brisk oven about 15 minute. 9.—" Truth."</p>
      </div>
