      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0100" n="art0100">
        <p>E ROY AL MARRIAGE. SOUVENIRS RECHERCHES.—None more delightful than THE BETROTHAL BOUQUET and 'QUEEN OF 111 MAY' with Photo of H.S.H. PRINCEis MAY on each bottle. Is. 64.. arui 2s. 6d. per bottle, by n.)st 31. extra. Write to or call at HENRY M. ASHTON'S Pnarmacy, 63. Eankey-at..(Opposits Legh-st.,) Warrington. Please note the addr,ss. ,liio connection with any other firm a a einitht^ ram,</p>
