      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0111" n="art0111">
        <head>WATERLOO BRIDGE.</head>
        <p>WATERLOO BRIDGE.</p>
        <p>The following recommendation ot- the VAaterloo Bridge Committee was adopted on the motion of Mr. Pritchard "That the footway on the Canal side of High. street from Waterloo 13ridr to the Ship Caul Company's Warehouse be made with Granolithic pavement, and that tenders be invited for the work ; also that the foot- way on the North side of High-street and the East side of Waterloo-road from the " Derby Arms " to Du ke-st., be flagged."</p>
