      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0112" n="art0112">
        <head>FINANCE.</head>
        <p>FINANCE.</p>
        <p>The Finance Ccrnmittee reported receipts amounting to £487 24. 10. i., and recommended the payment of ac- 'counts amounting to £B4B is. Bd, on general fund and '257 16+. sd. on E.ibrary fund. The Committee recom- mended that the expenses of the deputation to London on June 20th. re Water Bill, amounting to £44. 6d., be paid ; and that a stn of £5O on account be paid to the LAW Clerk in respect of the costs of promoting the Water Bill.</p>
