      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0114" n="art0114">
        <head>TUFNUSSANCV: INSPIKIMR,</head>
        <p>TUFNUSSANCV: INSPIKIMR,</p>
        <p>Mr. Wisw-all InA;;ed that Mr. James Percival be ap- pointed Inspector of Nuisances for a further term of one year at a salary atter the rate of £125 a year, and that the consent of the Local Government Board be obtained to such appointment ; the year to date from July sth, 1893.—Mr. Ilankinson seconded.—Carried.</p>
